SUMMARY:Native American Heritage Month
DESCRIPTION:Native American Heritage Month recognizes the histories\, cultures\, contributions\, and continuing presence of Native American\, Alaska Native\, and Indigenous peoples. It is an opportunity to learn from Indigenous communities\, celebrate their diverse traditions\, and recognize their enduring connections to their lands and cultures. \nLearn more at the Smithsonian Institution.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/native-american-heritage-month/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/Native-American-Heritage-Month.png
END:VEVENT
