SUMMARY:International Day for Tolerance
DESCRIPTION:The International Day for Tolerance encourages respect\, understanding\, and appreciation for people whose beliefs\, cultures\, and experiences differ from our own. It reminds us that building inclusive communities begins with listening\, challenging prejudice\, and treating every person with dignity. \nLearn more at the United Nations (UNESCO) Website.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/2172/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/toleranceday-fullarticle.jpg
END:VEVENT
