SUMMARY:Transgender Day of Remembrance (TDOR)
DESCRIPTION:Transgender Day of Remembrance honors transgender and gender-diverse people who have lost their lives to anti-transgender violence. It is a time to remember those who have been taken from their communities\, stand against discrimination and hate\, and reaffirm our commitment to safety\, dignity\, and inclusion for transgender people. \nLearn more at GLAAD.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/transgender-day-of-remembrance-tdor/
LOCATION:CA
CATEGORIES:Season of Connection
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/GLAAD_TransgenderDayofRemebrance_Final_1200x630.jpg
