SUMMARY:Yolo County Library: English Conversation Group
DESCRIPTION:Practice speaking English with other learners in a relaxed and comfortable environment\, led by a native speaker. No registration is required\, and drop-in participants are always welcome. Location is the Arthur F. Turner Community Library in West Sacramento on Friday’s at 1:30 pm. For adults that are 18+ years old.
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/yolo-county-library-english-conversation-group-2/2026-11-27/
LOCATION:Arthur F Turner Community Library\, 1212 Merkley Avenue\, West Sacramento\, CA\, 95691\, United States
